  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Cherry MX style mechanical keyboard switch, Kailh/Gateron hot-swap socket and through-hole soldering, double-sided mounting. An alternative to \"SW_MX_HotSwap_THT_double\". Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: ISO Enter flipped upside down (courtyard only; switch orientation unchanged). No stabilizer PCB features. Plate-mount MX stabilizers can be used.")
